{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/lzejz3vwm7b6dpwl5qjm76p2rkowdbb.mp3","text":"不就是让我归类文档嘛，这种事我经常干，小菜一碟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/r6vfvey15u3klempq1u6t67dezlstbl.mp3","text":"博士快看我新做的视频，你一定会喜欢的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/jglhduifaur3jahbclh47ec01e14coz.mp3","text":"对，就是那个空心图标，帮忙点一下好嘛，啊，如果可以的话，旁边那个图标也点一下，嘿嘿，谢谢啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/b17f1cvg93sjq7sxepfaa4e4tgnmjdm.mp3","text":"素材！点子！梗！什么都想不出来！我要掉粉了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/sivd236727v3m9g8re0yv2zocx9vb9a.mp3","text":"我只是个业余的探险家啦，做好计划拍点儿东西就回来了，不会在外面待上太久。再说了，野外哪有自家小屋子舒服。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/iqdsy6epck0kqj3ie3dg62xs2grak8r.mp3","text":"医疗部的人肯定又和你说什么奇怪的话了吧。哎呀我承认，有些时候我是有那么点小冲动，但博士你放心，我绝对不会给你添麻烦的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/9r2bwoslntp2atbovng67xhntun220x.mp3","text":"视频剪辑可是我的绝活，你是要做罗德岛宣传片吗博士。有计划书？好的我看看。嗯......罗德岛注意事项、均衡饮食宣传片、消防教育片......这都是些什么啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/trsaa8z6w2bp10iezi0mqlelylow3j9.mp3","text":"直觉告诉我，有一只可怕的菲林就在附近，博士，你可要当心了。他们总会趁你分心的瞬间从黑暗的角落里跳出来，然后一爪子把你摁在地上。欸？不会？","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/9jdqhqkfubt3zfz0tv4iwhi81twvzeo.mp3","text":"和大家一起生活所获得的快乐和拍下新东西的快乐是能相加的！就是因为发现了这一点，我才决定来当干员的，这样，我的快乐，就可以分享给你了呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/9gdvw85o3pmls5rv2cvfwnubvcce4zv.mp3","text":"悄悄拍张照好了，嗯，就拍一张。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/o3vwucc694db73444i9bsilbetufulv.mp3","text":"大家好，这里是卡达的频道！唉？不能在博士房间拍素材？好吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/2vhkc5afxj15sdt9oj0aq1a4kkbr2in.mp3","text":"下次我来拍吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/1nnq98tjwk17b8i62g3ssquvthipdq6.mp3","text":"晋升了？好耶！我们来合个影纪念一下吧博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/86qeq3vr6j4aslbsqw0m3dfh4b8bkii.mp3","text":"放轻松，博士，我一兴奋就会这样，没什么好害怕的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/svaccwav97kg5wj733e4bczpr6doekq.mp3","text":"大家好呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/7bs9wkaibj4wuy9228o9z6wuaasuvq0.mp3","text":"包在我身上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/4ljspacrv477o5kskhvs4eyzcsd5qqs.mp3","text":"博士，可别落下什么哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/1faa9uopmxfs51tj4pvxipvs9pzdtb4.mp3","text":"看看这次能拍到些什么有趣的东西。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/cfz54rpdxzsnnttjybnmisn278f6vsk.mp3","text":"在呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/qyvp8yrefjm4giv7reh344o68chcxe3.mp3","text":"听你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/tdsvxictc0kdo2ha686rlvwtpmjwnx8.mp3","text":"无人机升空。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/bc23s5gwxmbakq3m9s8kfgmy27a2e80.mp3","text":"开工。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/162tx75dsiur96ukfeh2panyg17ggnt.mp3","text":"发射！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/icac91xokbn53m03z1y87dabnk0vveb.mp3","text":"大家让一下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/fhh81f26zuo8ef8pcyp7vhudyq469ej.mp3","text":"我看到你们了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/qtw7bljuxyo5f2yvvn9lswjn0bl6pm0.mp3","text":"来，看镜头！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/gwowch2fht9uv9hq4qviehr0i3emqcr.mp3","text":"刚刚那个片段简直酷毙了，一会回本舰记得来我这儿看啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/l33cmqxx4wvbyw4uhrx6w9agkhqqas1.mp3","text":"太精彩了，简直就是现成的作战记录。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/fgw6d1ipz850jt6v30q17z62h6ldyw2.mp3","text":"刚刚拍照的时候太兴奋，有人溜走了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/6hjq5t3q748l1l6apn3l4qa1ufra0g8.mp3","text":"镜头碎了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/3pkqiloba4c36q5n7nfpr9pi177jny9.mp3","text":"我的视频小窝要开张啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/m41j64kiccozh6ah4jinc6rmcdhsk4v.mp3","text":"哎呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/5g9k6yv19w4kmjjtopd0l9id6axjjms.mp3","text":"来博士，给你看个好东西。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/dw7piv8teljvty6hynyiqu6mxwem0t7.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/ixid1nq0vmn7nlq8ilhpy0r23guikf9.mp3","text":"哦！我突然想到一个新点子，等下等下，摄像机在哪，这里有没有个地方可以布置三脚架？博士，帮我试验一下，待会儿放烟花的时候你看向窗外，我拍一下你的眼睛——","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/4r74r80oguyof5bl5uhrd9lpi2rhtw2.mp3","text":"嗨~","alt":"voice_cn/char_328_cammou/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/cnubnbnjuf9fxi4awvk1v83y5mj0831.mp3","text":"不就是让我归类文档嘛，这种事我经常干，小菜一碟。","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/pmv98a2s0axn28y4bv5niesipnd59rt.mp3","text":"博士快看我新做的视频，你一定会喜欢的。","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/4l5i2tg8tcz9obw0crfpxljatf5np3o.mp3","text":"对，就是那个空心图标，帮忙点一下好嘛，啊，如果可以的话，旁边那个图标也点一下，嘿嘿，谢谢啦。","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/oryfqvrx7od5ydws5a5f4c8b6nf7bny.mp3","text":"素材！点子！梗！什么都想不出来！我要掉粉了......","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/q0mvw503b6hix990yvk6jf5v10psyl8.mp3","text":"我只是个业余的探险家啦，做好计划拍点儿东西就回来了，不会在外面待上太久。再说了，野外哪有自家小屋子舒服。","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/06l9afahb4ql9occookqx7nhedy61k1.mp3","text":"医疗部的人肯定又和你说什么奇怪的话了吧。哎呀我承认，有些时候我是有那么点小冲动，但博士你放心，我绝对不会给你添麻烦的。","alt":"voice/char_328_cammou/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/otoclil9v4ww808skky7uynhctcyytb.mp3","text":"视频剪辑可是我的绝活，你是要做罗德岛宣传片